    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deeloodá' ur ar Pasaáka iwa fák, múk Israeli sleémeero tari tláy baraá umuú gixsár Yudawo. Uheemidá' taa tlehhiít kiri feé/ kiri giqáy, munguúdá' ta bay Ashera kuri supín, wa/angwduú gawaá gongoamo' kudá' munguaá hatlá' kiwa sluufmaamisi kiri feé/. Inooín adoorí kana tleéhh baraá yaamaá Yuda nee awa Benyamini, nee Efraimu nee awa Manasewo sleeme. Tí kawa hhe'eés, umuú heewo iri waátl amór gixsarós nee dír aalirós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hesekia kaahamuusér Mungú nee múk Laáwiwo giri malé qaás baraá gadiyeédí ale, as tawa gadiyuusi baraá Doó Mungú wa ale. Gadiyér ngi qasmiís a ilahhooa da/a/aangw, nee ilahhooár wayda hanmis, niwa gadiyuusiya' dír afkú heémár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale, nee xirfayeemis nee sluufaywo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hesekia daqaari'iimarós gana bahh haniís as tawa ilahhooár da/a ar matlaatle nee ar tsiindowo, nee tawa ilahhooár deelór Sabaáto nee ar bál slahhángw /abén, nee ar deelór uren, tidá' taa hara'ayín as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, adoodá' kara gooín baraá kitaábuú dabér AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo múk Yerusalemu guri malé ádbáy, daqaari'iimar'ín ngiwa bahh haniisiya' dír kaahamuusér Mungú nee múk tlahhoó Laáwi, as kahhó' inooín tiwa haniisiya' baraá gadiyér dabér AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí múk Israeli nguwa axaás, daqaari'iimar'ín ngina ló'wa haniisiyé', bu'úngw geera, nee difaái, nee di/i, nee danú, nee muruú hatlá' oo ta hamaareés baraá qamuuín wa alé. Nee umuúqo gár wák baraá mibaango ar umuú gár i kona'a ngina huwiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli nee oo Yuda kudá' baraá gixsadaá Yuda hoót, gár wák baraá muruú mibaangw oo hikwa nee bee/aangw ngina huwiyé', kari paraátl as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Muuruuwí kuna qamín baraá daqooraay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slahhángw tame muruuwí baraá daqooráy qamiingo kuna iimu/ún, nee slahhángw faanqwe kway hhe'eés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hesekia nee mukduú geeraharuuse tay daqáy as daqooraydá' taa burumbuúr kuwa ari, inooín AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngway sluufisiyé', nee mukduú Israeli daqaari'iimar'ín gaa haniisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hesekia kaahamuusér Mungú nee múk Laáwi giri yaahaás daanduú daqooraywí ta buruumburi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asariya kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú, kuduú xwaylár Sadoki, guri mu/aywaáts, «Iimír muu muruuwí huwaahubuwo nguwa iimu/ún baraá doo Mungú, muruú /aymár yaariír ugwa slawaán nee oo yaariír aa meét. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ mukós gwaa tsuuqaá yaariír i haniís, an gár muruuwí sleémeero kusa slawaán.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo waawutmo Hesekia giri ádbáy meeweé kawa tleehhi baraá kutuwír doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Inooín ngiri tleehhiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balangwdá' tinda hanmiís nee ar wák baraá mibaango, nee muruudá' taa paraátl as Mungú, kuri baraá doó Mungú i baáts ar inkihhimu. Konania heé tlahhoó Laáwi kuri qaás heé úr wa ale, as muruudá' nguwa amohhe'eemisi, nee hhiyaawós Shimei an alee/isusmoowós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehieli, nee Asasia, nee Nahati, nee Asaheli, nee Yerimoti, nee Yosabadi, nee Elieli, nee Ismakia, nee Mahati nee Benaya, kiri qaás ga/aawuusér wa ale. Konania gin geeraharahaar, nee Shimei hhiyaawós. Mukwí sleémeero kuna tsawaár nee waawutmo Hesekia nee Asariya geeraharusmoó úr oo Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kore garmoó Imna heé tlahhoó Laáwi, kuduú xuumusmoó afkú do' oo da/aáw oo Doó Mungú. Inós a sagesihhitusmoó muruudá' muu na huwahuúw ar sla'aarir'ín dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, nee qasmisuú muruudá' taa hanmiisi dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, nee ilahhooadá' ló'wa hhohho'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edeni, nee Miniamini, nee Yeshua, nee Shemaya, nee Amaria, nee Shekania, inooín nguna alee/iisiyé' gadiyeérí tlehhtuuwo ar inkihhimu baraá gixsaduudaá hatlá' awa kaahamuusér Mungú aa hoti. Inooín hhaeeín kudaá múk Laáwi ngina muruú /aymár i qasmiisiyé' awa uren nee awa ninakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám inooín ta hhaslitiiká, laqaá tlahhoó hee i dirii'i kwa leelehhiiká, inooín na/iidaá daaqaay awa kureeraá tám ngaa aye', nee awa ngaa ba/iye', kudá' daraahá' baraá doó Mungú, gadiyér'ín ngi boo/eemisá', umuú heewo qoomaydá' inós wa hariím guna sláy, ar adór gadiyeédá' aa tleéhh bál baalaqaasirose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamuusér Mungú kana gooín ar adoodá' tlahh'ii'ín i dirii'iya'. Múk tlahhoó Laáwi oo taa gooín a kudá' kureeraá mibeeri tsár ngaa aye', nee ngaa ba/iye', nee kina gooín ar adoodá' gadiyér'ín i diri' nee baalaqaasir'ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín kina dinkwár i gooín nee na/ii'ín awa ninakw, nee tlaaway'ine, nee daaqaay nee dasuuine, ar adoodá' gadiyér'ín ngir tlehhaahhitiya'. Inooín umuú daqto ki inkihhím tiwa hhohhoeemisiya' baraá gadiyér'ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám kaahamuusér Mungú ar xwaylár Aroni ar baraá qamaá hoot, kudá' ta aliiti tsee/aá gixsar'ín, múk taa qaás i deer oo qoomoó muruú /aymar'ín gu qasmiís. Umuú heewo tidá' inós wa hariim gan slasláy, inós bar garma baraá kaahamuusér Munguhe, nee umuú heewo oo múk Laáwi oo taa qo gooini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí an adoodá' waawutmo Hesekia hhooeema ngira tleéhh, tidá' ganaá' nee tidá' inkihhím geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwós, baraá yaamaá Yudawo sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú gadiyér aa qo tleehhi baraá doó Munguhe ar adoodá' dabe nee hara'aya ngir kat, as geeraharu'uumár Munguúwós ngiwa eehari, gadiyeé gana tleéhh ar muunaáwós sleémeero, nee gari aleesláy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
